      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR. NICKO (4) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Gosford over 603m behind Why Me (36.25) in a Mix. Was in the money prior to that. Should be very hard to beat this time. MYTHIC (5) showed a solid effort after showing good speed to lead to win by 0.8 lengths at Gunnedah over 527m (30.78) in a Grade 5. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. ZIPPING DESIRE (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (35.94) at Gosford behind Why Me in a Mix. Got back and turned spotting a start but found the line impressively. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Bold showing expected. TEQUILA GIRL (1) can measure up with the right run.",
